ef="${esc(s.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(s.title)} <span>↗</span></a>`).join("")}</div>
      <p class="mini-note">Desarrollado por: Ángel Soto · Itinerario privado.</p>`;
  }
  function buildSearchIndex(){
    const items=[];
    data.days.forEach(d=>d.timeline.forEach(e=>items.push({kind:`${d.shortLabel} · itinerario`,title:e.title,text:`${e.note} ${e.travel} ${d.zone}`,mapQuery:e.mapQuery})));
    data.places.forEach(p=>items.push({kind:"Visita",title:p.name,text:`${p.type} ${p.area} ${p.notes}`,mapQuery:p.mapQuery,website:p.website}));
    data.restaurants.forEach(r=>items.push({kind:"Restaurante",title:r.name,text:`${r.type} ${r.area} ${r.reason} ${r.reservation}`,mapQuery:r.mapQuery,website:r.website}));
    data.nightlife.forEach(n=>items.push({kind:"Noche",title:n.name,text:`${n.type} ${n.area} ${n.vibe} ${n.notes}`,mapQuery:n.mapQuery,website:n.website}));
    return items;
  }
  const searchIndex=buildSearchIndex();
  function renderSearch(query){
    const q=query.trim().toLocaleLowerCase("es");
    $("#clearSearch").classList.toggle("hidden",!q);
    if(!q){$("#searchResults").classList.add("hidden");$("#dayDetail").classList.remove("hidden");return;}
    const hits=searchIndex.filter(i=>`${i.title} ${i.text} ${i.kind}`.toLocaleLowerCase("es").includes(q)).slice(0,40);
    $("#dayDetail").classList.add("hidden");$("#searchResults").classList.remove("hidden");
    $("#searchResults").innerHTML=`<div class="section-title"><div><h2>Resultados</h2><p>${hits.length} coincidencias para “${esc(query)}”.</p></div></div>
      <div class="place-list">${hits.length?hits.map(i=>`<article class="place-card search-hit"><div class="place-emoji">⌕</div><div><span class="pill">${esc(i.kind)}</span><h3>${esc(i.title)}</h3><p>${esc(i.text)}</p>${mapActions(i)}</div></article>`).join(""):`<div class="empty">No hay resultados. Prueba con “Parlamento”, “Menza” o “baños”.</div>`}</div>`;
  }
  $("#globalSearch").addEventListener("input",e=>renderSearch(e.target.value));
  $("#clearSearch").addEventListener("click",()=>{$("#globalSearch").value="";renderSearch("");$("#globalSearch").focus();});

  function toggleSheet(show){
    $("#moreSheet").classList.toggle("hidden",!show);$("#sheetBackdrop").classList.toggle("hidden",!show);
  }
  $("#moreButton").addEventListener("click",()=>toggleSheet(true));
  $("#sheetBackdrop").addEventListener("click",()=>toggleSheet(false));
  $$(".more-sheet a").forEach(a=>a.addEventListener("click",()=>toggleSheet(false)));

  $("#shareTrip").addEventListener("click",async()=>{
    const share={title:data.meta.title,text:"Itinerario privado del viaje a Budapest.",url:location.href};
    try{if(navigator.share) await navigator.share(share); else {await navigator.clipboard.writeText(location.href);showToast("Enlace copiado");}}catch(_){}
  });

  function renderAll(){
    renderOverview();renderTabs();renderDay();renderHotel();renderSites();renderFood();renderNight();renderFlights();render